# Under Claw Work

The current Agent uses Under Claw Work as a provider-neutral Task, Meta Prompt,
skill, audit, and durable-memory layer. Under Claw Work does not replace the
Agent or model.

Preserve original Drafts, keep generated and approved Meta revisions distinct,
and require canonical evidence for execution. The skill bundle contains
`under-claw-work`, `under-claw-work-plan`, `under-claw-meta-prompt`,
`under-claw-jarvis-plan-loop`, and `under-claw-jarvis-plan`.
